  "_comment": "Provenance for the WebHTV build of Libmpv.xcframework. IOS-POC-17I-1. .github/workflows/ios-libmpv-build.yml is the only thing that reads this file: it rebuilds libmpv alone from the MPVKit 1.0.0 recipe with patches.replacement in place of the upstream 0001, restores every other library from the zips pinned under dependencies, compares the result with reference, and fails on any hash mismatch or unpinned download. The artifact is a GitHub release asset, not a tracked file.",
