      "note": "Identical to the upstream 0001 except video/out/vulkan/context_moltenvk.m, which now reports layer resizes to mpv. Resize logic from edde746/MPVKit e6b129fdd31347b25d5d862f73f52c23f9e55624, changed as docs/IOS-POC-17I-mpv-resize-libmpv.md records. Applies to mpv v0.41.0 before the upstream 0002 and 0003."
