    "upstream": "macos-14, Xcode 15.4, meson 1.4.2 (MPVKit .github/workflows/build.yml at build_commit).",
    "note": "The recipe runs tools with its own PATH and installs the newest meson from Homebrew if none is on it, so the workflow links the pinned meson into /opt/homebrew/bin and checks the version before building."
  },
